 "public showReferencesTo: names <Array[Symbol]> = (\n			(* Open a list of references to the provided selectors. *)\n			\n			| selectors <List[Symbol]> = Utilities computeSelectorsFrom: names. searchString <String> = selectors inject: ''\n				into: [:acc <String> :sel <Symbol> | acc , sel , ';' ]. |\n			enterSubject: (SearchResultsSubject onModel: searchString)\n		)",
