 "public setValue: expression <String> ifCompilerError: compileFailBlock ifError: failBlock = (\n			| evalThread <ThreadMirror> |\n			evalThread:: [ objectMirror evaluate: expression with: Map new ] on: Error\n				do: [:ce <Error> | compileFailBlock value: ce printString ].\n			evalThread isBroken ifTrue: \n				(* so for runtime errors, the block should take a thread so it can open a debugger on it *)\n				[ failBlock value: evalThread ]\n				ifFalse: [ objectMirror setLazySlot: name to: evalThread result reflectee ]\n		)",
