 "public addFromSource: source <String> ^<LazySlotBuilder> = (\n			(* Compile a lazy slot declaration and add (or replace) its builder,\n	   mirroring the psoup LazySlotBuilder addFromSource: flow. The runtime\n	   effect happens at install: the reconstructed source (which includes\n	   the group''s lazy declarations) is recompiled, the schema-change slot\n	   diff adds the backing slot to live instances, and the method copy\n	   installs the accessors. Without this override the send fell through\n	   to ImmutableMirrorGroup and raised. *)\n			\n			| iSlot <IntermediateLazySlot> newBuilder <LazySlotBuilder> |\n			iSlot:: compiler compileLazySlotSource: source within: definingMixin.\n			\n			(* TODO: check for name conflicts, as the psoup version does *)\n			newBuilder:: LazySlotBuilder reflecting: iSlot in: definingMixin.\n			removeMirrorNamed: iSlot name.\n			addMirror: newBuilder.\n			^newBuilder\n		)",
