 "public class SimulatedActivation new = Object new (\n		(* One simulated frame: the upstream VM Activation, reified. Temps and the operand stack share one one-origin indexed area, upstream-style: parameters, then locals, then operands. *)\n		\n		|\n			public sender <SimulatedActivation | nil>\n			public bci <Integer> ::= 1.\n			public method <SimulatedMethod>\n			public closure <SimulatedClosure | nil>\n			public receiver <Object>\n			public isDead <Boolean> ::= false.\n			public unwindProtectorRan <Boolean> ::= false.\n			frame <List> = List new.\n			stackPointer <Integer> ::= 0.\n			\n			(* Statement-level restart support (transplanted frames): the bci of the top-level statement containing the failure, computed at transplant from the parsed source. 1 = unresolved: Continue then degrades to a full restart from the method start. *)\n			public restartBci <Integer> ::= 1.\n		|\n	)",
 "new",
