 "public add: el <E> after: existing <E> ^<E> = (\n			| index <Int> |\n			index:: indexOf: existing.\n			index = size ifFalse: [\n					index:: makeSpace: 1 beforeIndex: index + startGap + 1\n				]\n				ifTrue: [\n					needSpaceAtEnd: 1.\n					index:: index + startGap + 1\n				].\n			^contents at: index put: el\n		)",
