 "public replaceFrom: start <Int> to: stop <Int> with: other <List[E]> startingAt: repStart <Int> = (\n			(* replace the elements of the receiver from start to stop with elements from other,\n	  starting with the element of other with index repStart. *)\n			\n			| otheri <Int> |\n			(start >= 1 and: [ stop <= size ]) ifFalse: [ error: 'range out of bounds' ].\n			contents replaceFrom: start + startGap\n				to: stop + startGap\n				with: other\n				startingAt: repStart\n		)",
 "public defaultCapacity ^<Int> = (\n			^5\n		)",
