 "new",
 "public add: element <E> ^<E> = (\n			| index |\n			index:: scanFor: element.\n			index < 0 ifTrue: [ ^insert: 0 - index element: element ].\n			^data_ at: (hashtable_ at: index) put: element\n		)",
