 "insert: bucketIndex element: element = (\n			| keyIndex |\n			keyIndex:: size_ + deleted_ + 1.\n			size_:: 1 + size_.\n			data_ at: keyIndex put: element.\n			hashtable_ at: bucketIndex put: keyIndex.\n			keyIndex + 1 > data_ size ifTrue: [ rehash ].\n			^element\n		)",
