 "class RuntimeForCroquetJS packageUsing: manifest = Object new (\n	(* Provides the platform object for Newspeak on Javascript under Croquet: the Javascript analogue of RuntimeForCroquet, differing from RuntimeForJSWithMirrorBuilders in exactly three slots — js (per-session local storage via JSForCroquet), hopscotch (HopscotchForCroquet layered over HopscotchForHTML5) and host (HostForCroquet, routing requests through the coordinated-IO scheme) — plus the isKindOfPlatformWithCroquet predicate. Deploys built with this runtime need the Croquet support script (see DeploymentManager JSPackager croquetSupportScript) on the page, gating Newspeak boot on Session.join.\n\nCopyright 2012 Google Inc.\nCopyright 2013 Ryan Macnak\n\nLicensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the ''License''); you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.  You may obtain a copy of the License at  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 *)\n	\n	|\n		private BuildInfo = manifest BuildInfo.\n		Kernel = manifest KernelForJS.\n		Actors = manifest ActorsForJS.\n		Aliens = manifest AliensForJS.\n		Collections = manifest Collections.\n		Mirrors = manifest MirrorsForJS.\n		public MirrorGroups = manifest MirrorGroups.\n		Streams = manifest Streams.\n		private Ducts = manifest Ducts.\n		private VoiceController = manifest VoiceController.\n		private AIAccess = manifest AIAccess.\n		private HopscotchForHTML5 = manifest HopscotchForHTML5.\n		private HopscotchForCroquet = manifest HopscotchForCroquet.\n		private JSForCroquet = manifest JSForCroquet.\n		private Host = manifest Host.\n		private HostForCroquet = manifest HostForCroquet.\n		private Graphics = manifest GraphicsForHTML5.\n		private Fonts = manifest FontsForHTML5.\n		private TextModule = manifest TextModule.\n		public CombinatorialParsing = manifest CombinatorialParsing.\n		public NewspeakGrammar = manifest NewspeakGrammar.\n		public NewspeakASTs = manifest NewspeakASTs.\n		public NewspeakParsing = manifest NewspeakParsing.\n		public MetadataParsing = manifest MetadataParsing.\n		public JavascriptGeneration = manifest JavascriptGeneration.\n		public Compilation = manifest Newspeak2JSCompilation mixinApply: manifest NewspeakCompilation.\n		public V5BytecodeSimulation = manifest V5BytecodeSimulation.\n		public BytecodeSimulatorForJS = manifest BytecodeSimulatorForJS.\n		\n		(* The V5 bytecode-emission stack, for dual emission in reflective compiles (debugging freshly accepted methods and expression doIts). Conventional imports: deployment packaging is demand-driven by these very manifest sends (DeploymentManager's extractSourcesFromConfiguration: records them), so every deploy carrying this runtime packages the modules. *)\n		public BytecodeCompilation = manifest Newspeak2V5BytecodeCompilation mixinApply: (manifest NewspeakBytecodeCompilation mixinApply: manifest NewspeakCompilation).\n		public BytecodeIntermediates = manifest IntermediatesForPrimordialSoup.\n		private imagePaths = ImagePaths packageUsing: manifest.\n	|\n)",
