 "asyncContent: producer <[:Object | Object]> initially: ic <Fragment> ^<Fragment> = (\n			(* A fragment that shows `ic` immediately, then runs `producer`, handing\n     it a one-argument `fill` callback. When the producer's async work\n     completes, it calls `fill value: aFragment` and that fragment replaces the\n     placeholder. See AsyncContentComposer. *)\n			\n			^AsyncContentComposer initially: ic producer: producer\n		)",
