 "class LiveLabelFragment computing: b <[String]> every: ms <Integer> = StaticLabelFragment text: '' (\n		(* A label whose text is recomputed by `compute` every `intervalMs`\n	   milliseconds, for values that change while the page is otherwise static\n	   (elapsed time, a phase read off a model that has no change notification).\n	   Only this node's textContent is touched on a tick; no presenter refresh.\n\n	   The interval is released on noticeDisposal (the fragment lost its visual\n	   to a different-kind successor or was removed) and handed over on\n	   updateVisualsFromSameKind: (a same-kind successor takes the node). As a\n	   fallback a tick that finds its visual no longer connected to the document\n	   stops itself, so no interval can outlive its node. *)\n		\n		|\n			compute <[String]> = b.\n			intervalMs <Integer> = ms.\n			timerId\n		|\n		refreshText.\n	)",
 "text: ''",
 "text: ''",
 "createVisual = (\n			| element = super createVisual. |\n			startTicking.\n			^element\n		)",
