 "class GraphicsForHTML5 usingPlatform: p\n(* :exemplar: platform graphics *)\n = Object new (\n	(* Core graphics support for Newspeak.\n\nCopyright Google Inc. 2015 - 2017 *)\n	\n	|\n		private js = p js.\n	|\n	(* Should be a lazy slot *)\n	\n)",
