 "lazy document = (* Making #document lazy allows us to use the C version of Psoup to generate vfuel files from platforms that include this module.  Since one cannot actually call JS from the C based serializer, we want to delay accessing the JS module's properties until we are actually running. *) js global at: 'document'.",
